    "question": "A1's question, with a positive control that cannot fail for biological reasons",
    "why_A1_refused": "its physical control Krt8 against Krt18 assumed the two loci share peaks; the vendor annotation assigns each peak to its nearest gene, so they largely do not, and the control was a real biological question rather than an arithmetic identity",
    "R7b_split_locus_control": "20 genes, each with its linked peak set split at random into two halves treated as two loci; the halves sit in one regulatory domain by construction, so the measurement must detect them; the median of their ratios is the gate",
