    "budget_not_raised": "A1 showed the null spread is wide in the shallower deposit, but raising the budget after seeing the direction of the Axin2 result would be choosing a parameter to suit an answer. If the split-locus control also fails, the approach is underpowered at this depth and this folder says so",
